ue of are  we going to  go to court and if we do what is the  practical implications of trying  uh potential crimes that happen 15 16 17  years prior to that it's going to be  a very interesting um issue  to be debated over the next few years  and the legalities of it are going to be  equally  fascinating i'm sure we'll be returning  to the subject in the future at some  stage i'm sure roger shanahan from the  loewy institute  in sydney thanks so much for joining us  sir  my pleasure
 

